   "translatable": true,
   "reachable": true,
   "same_as": "",
   "original": "IN 3656, THE SPACE  BATTLESHIP THAT YOU PILOT NAMED CENTURY PARODY, WARPS OUT   FROM THE KGD STAR   CLUSTER TOWARDS THE QUILA STAR SYSTEM.                      ",
   "translation": "西元3656年，\n你所駕駛的太空戰艦\n「世紀諧擬號」，\n正從KGD星團躍遷，\n朝奎拉星系前進。",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "key": "PW.EXE:cs:0327",
   "kind": "block",
   "font": "font6",
   "width": 160,
   "lines": [
    20,
    20,
    20,
    20,
    20,
    20,
    20,
    20
   ],
   "translatable": true,
   "reachable": true,
   "same_as": "",
   "original": "THIS STORY BEGINS   WHEN YOU LAND ON A  TRADE STATION NAMED SAMAR, THAT ORBITS APLANET ON THE EDGE  OF THE QUILA        CLUSTER.                                ",
   "translation": "故事，要從你降落\n在薩瑪貿易站的\n那一刻說起。\n薩瑪，正繞著奎拉\n星團邊緣的一顆\n行星運行。",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "key": "PW.EXE:cs:03C7",
   "kind": "block",
   "font": "font6",
   "width": 160,
   "lines": [
    20,
    20,
    20,
    20,
    20,
    20,
    20,
    20
   ],
   "translatable": true,
   "reachable": true,
   "same_as": "",
   "original": "YOU AND KAYLA, THE  ANDROID, LEAVE THE  BATTLESHIP AND ENTERSAMAR. THUS BEGINS  THE FULLFILLMENT OF AN ANCIENT PROPHESY.                                        ",
   "translation": "你和生化複合人\n凱拉，一同走出\n戰艦，踏入薩瑪。\n一則古老的預言，\n就此展開。",
   "note": ""
  },
